c432e0681fbdc74.0.3.0"><p data-reactid=".1fab6pdt5ea.3.0.0.1.0.$lx-commentary.$lx-commentary.2.0.1.1:$post-5c757f177c432e0681fbdc74.0.3.0.0:$post_0">Metro Bank said its 2018 net profit more than doubled to £27m and it says it already has a nice, fat capital buffer. The £350m it wants is to fund growth, it said. So that's, er, good news then?</p><p data-reactid=".1fab6pdt5ea.3.0.0.1.0.$lx-commentary.$lx-commentary.2.0.1.1:$post-5c757f177c432e0681fbdc74.0.3.0.0:$post_1">Well, the lender is now under investigation by the Bank of England for that update last month on risky mortgages that sent the shares tanking. </p><p data-reactid=".1fab6pdt5ea.3.0.0.1.0.$lx-commentary.$lx-commentary.2.0.1.1:$post-5c757f177c432e0681fbdc74.0.3.0.0:$post_2">It is quite unusual to announce a capital raise <a href="https://www.investegate.co.uk/metro-bank-plc--mtro-/rns/metro-bank-standby-underwrite---prelim-results/201902261624361891R/" alt="six minutes before the end of trading">six minutes before the end of trading<span class="lx-stream-post-body__external-link gel-icon gel-icon-external-link"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M12 0v5h11.5l-5 5H0v22h22V17.5l-2 2V30H2V12h14.5l-7.8 7.7 3.6 3.6L27 8.5V20h5V0z"></path></svg></span></a> without saying what you plan to do with the money, and then <a href="https://www.investegate.co.uk/metro-bank-plc--mtro-/rns/prelim-full-year-results---q4-trading-update-2018/201902261719531950R/" alt="report earnings after hours">report earnings after hours<span class="lx-stream-post-body__external-link gel-icon gel-icon-external-link"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M12 0v5h11.5l-5 5H0v22h22V17.5l-2 2V30H2V12h14.5l-7.8 7.7 3.6 3.6L27 8.5V20h5V0z"></path></svg></span></a>. </p><noscript data-reactid=".1fab6pdt5ea.3.0.0.1.0.$lx-commentary.$lx-commentary.2.0.1.1:$post-5c757f177c432e0681fbdc74.0.3.0.1"></noscript></div></div><footer class="lx-stream-post__footer" data-reactid=".1fab6pdt5ea.3.0.0.1.0.$lx-commentary.$lx-commentary.2.0.1.1:$post-5c757f177c432e06